					"usage_notes": "Blunt Claws (10): thrust 1d-2 crushing (KYOS: 1d-3 crushing), Reach C."
				},
				{
					"id": "Am2dwubtE76X4gvyw",
					"damage": {
						"type": "pi-",
						"base": "1d"
					},
					"usage": "Breath Weapon",
					"defaults": [
						{
							"type": "10",
							"modifier": 3
						}
					],
					"usage_notes": "Breath Weapon (13): A 10-yard jet of salt crystals erupts from the mephit’s mouth. It uses Innate Attack (Breath) to hit. Don’t apply range penalties; treat this as a long melee weapon rather than a ranged attack. It does 1d small piercing damage, and has a 1/2D range of 5 yards. If any damage penetrates the target’s DR, he must make a HT roll, at -1 per 2 points of injury or suffer from itching skin and eyes for (20 – HT) minutes. The target is at -2 to DX for the duration of the itch. Scratching for one full second relieves the itch, but the target can do nothing else while scratching. This ability costs 1 FP to use."
				}
			]
		}
