	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "AEu9LRRdfbCmD6cAf",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 9, DX 10, IQ 9, HT 11, HP 9, WILL 9, PER 9, FP 11, SPEED 5.25, MOVE 5, DODGE 8, DR 1. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "A8VWpxZxH2BhnNHDV",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 5 (offense 5, protection 0), threat tier minor, appearing 4."
		},
		{
			"id": "A35Z_XM6WSTIdfOrc",
			"text": "Drain Moisture (1d fatigue), reach 4 yards: By spending 4 FP, a salt mephit can drain moisture from the area around him. Every creature within 4 yards of him takes 1d fatigue damage. Treat FP lost to the attack identically to FP lost to dehydration for all purposes, notably recovery."
		},
